<title>HONG KONG: Guangdong Development Bank to set US$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Guangdong Development Bank to set US$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guangdong Development Bank, acting through its Macau branch, has mandated Standard Chartered Bank and WestLB to arrange a US$50 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a final maturity of three years with a call option in year two.</p>
<p>The deal will be launched in early May, bankers said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
